    {
      "id": "n9",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 260,
        "content": "## AI Lead Responder\nBuilt by Sara Abbasi · SheCodesAI\n\n1. **Settings**: change the business name, your email and the facts.\n2. **Ask AI**: add a *Header Auth* credential: name `x-api-key`, value = your AI provider's API key. Then set `model` in Settings.\n3. **Save lead to Sheet**: connect Google, paste your Sheet URL. The sheet tab `Leads` needs the headers: date, name, email, course, message, category, priority, reply\n4. **Reply / Alert**: connect Gmail.\n5. Open the form URL from **Enquiry form** and test!"
      }
    }
